<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 12.5 bln Greek drachma bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 12.5 bln Greek drachma bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    12.5 BLN GRD  COUPON     9.375     MATURITY    18.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.475   PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.50     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS 250K, 2.5M    SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
